(2471769, 340294, 43463, '<td valign="top">After a long cold spell of this winter scene most would definately be singing "Here comes the Sun" when the sun comes out:-) Beautiful landscape with dark and cold clouds over this white blanketed earth. Though the snow is not a brilliant white it is better this way for it leans more to the mood of feeling blue and being cold.</td>', 'After a long cold spell of this winter scene most would definately be singing "Here comes the Sun" when the sun comes out:-) Beautiful landscape with dark and cold clouds over this white blanketed earth. Though the snow is not a brilliant white it is better this way for it leans more to the mood of feeling blue and being cold.', '2006-05-31 11:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
