(2472178, 340624, 14837, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  It looks like a floating head in that booth! haha</td>', 'Great shot!  It looks like a floating head in that booth! haha', '2006-05-31 13:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472184, 340362, 14837, '<td valign="top">I wish the man was a bit more in focus, or the picture of the couple... the wall seems to be focused a bit more so.  Still, great idea.</td>', 'I wish the man was a bit more in focus, or the picture of the couple... the wall seems to be focused a bit more so.  Still, great idea.', '2006-05-31 13:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472185, 340022, 14837, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like how the 2 red ones stand out.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like how the 2 red ones stand out.', '2006-05-31 13:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472186, 339447, 14837, '<td valign="top">The photo is a bit dark for my taste.</td>', 'The photo is a bit dark for my taste.', '2006-05-31 13:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472187, 340729, 14837, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, but her facial features could be a tad sharper.</td>', 'Nice portrait, but her facial features could be a tad sharper.', '2006-05-31 13:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472190, 340499, 14837, '<td valign="top">His facial features could be a bit more in focus</td>', 'His facial features could be a bit more in focus', '2006-05-31 13:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472193, 339173, 14837, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Awesome capture!</td>', 'Wow!  Awesome capture!', '2006-05-31 13:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472197, 339389, 14837, '<td valign="top">Great concept.  My only suggestions, are that she should be more in focus.  The whole picture has a slightly blurry look to it.  Try focusing on the eyes, it''s the main focal point when shooting pictures of people.  Also, the light on her arm is harsh.  Try bringing your light up and lighting from the top, or pull your subject further away from the backlight.  Hope this helps  :)</td>', 'Great concept.  My only suggestions, are that she should be more in focus.  The whole picture has a slightly blurry look to it.  Try focusing on the eyes, it''s the main focal point when shooting pictures of people.  Also, the light on her arm is harsh.  Try bringing your light up and lighting from the top, or pull your subject further away from the backlight.  Hope this helps  :)', '2006-05-31 13:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472199, 340792, 14837, '<td valign="top">What a great idea!</td>', 'What a great idea!', '2006-05-31 13:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472204, 340144, 14837, '<td valign="top">This is hilarious!  I would make the picture a bit bigger so that the voters can see more detail.  It looks like you took the time to set up a great shot (complete with costumes and props) be sure to show them off.  I would also up your levels a bit.  The picture is kinda flat, and adding some more contrast would bring it up.  This is a great picture, you get a 7 from me!</td>', 'This is hilarious!  I would make the picture a bit bigger so that the voters can see more detail.  It looks like you took the time to set up a great shot (complete with costumes and props) be sure to show them off.  I would also up your levels a bit.  The picture is kinda flat, and adding some more contrast would bring it up.  This is a great picture, you get a 7 from me!', '2006-05-31 13:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472207, 340556, 14837, '<td valign="top">haha!  Just a bit out of focus, but funny!  :)</td>', 'haha!  Just a bit out of focus, but funny!  :)', '2006-05-31 13:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
