(2473177, 340164, 46466, '<td valign="top">That guy is creepy looking. He probably has a knife to her back. I''m kidding of course... It''s more likely a gun. Again, kidding, he''s not creepy looking, I just don''t have anything worthwhile to say.</td>', 'That guy is creepy looking. He probably has a knife to her back. I''m kidding of course... It''s more likely a gun. Again, kidding, he''s not creepy looking, I just don''t have anything worthwhile to say.', '2006-05-31 18:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
