(2473270, 340540, 6999, '<td valign="top">I think you might have been just a little more careful with your background - such a simple set-up is easily defeated by the odd discoloured leaf in that foliage.</td>', 'I think you might have been just a little more careful with your background - such a simple set-up is easily defeated by the odd discoloured leaf in that foliage.', '2006-05-31 19:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473271, 340496, 49716, '<td valign="top">One of my 10''s.  I think youhave done a great job of capturing the title in the image.  Obviously a set-up, but has a really nice ''candid'' feel to it.</td>', 'One of my 10''s.  I think youhave done a great job of capturing the title in the image.  Obviously a set-up, but has a really nice ''candid'' feel to it.', '2006-05-31 19:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473277, 340168, 6999, '<td valign="top">There are seven bits of stuff here - and <i>I</i> don''t think the idea really needs more than two; simplifying would help, but there''s little sense of shape to your arrangement of those objects either.</td>', 'There are seven bits of stuff here - and I don''t think the idea really needs more than two; simplifying would help, but there''s little sense of shape to your arrangement of those objects either.', '2006-05-31 19:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
