(2473816, 340721, 42125, '<td valign="top">It is very simple to change this picture to something good.<br/>If you use Photoshop or GIMP (free software) using the Levels function you can easily make the black to be black in stead of grey. This makes the picture much better to look at.<br/>It took me 20sec to change this. You can look at the results here:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=341257" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/42125/thumb/341257.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/42125/thumb/341257.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/42125/thumb/341257.jpg"/></a> <br/>It was also possible since this is Adwanced editing to selectively select things from the picture and use the levels function to enhance. Leave that one to you.<br/>The picture is also a bit grainy, use NeatImage (free) to enhance too.</td>', 'It is very simple to change this picture to something good.If you use Photoshop or GIMP (free software) using the Levels function you can easily make the black to be black in stead of grey. This makes the picture much better to look at.It took me 20sec to change this. You can look at the results here: It was also possible since this is Adwanced editing to selectively select things from the picture and use the levels function to enhance. Leave that one to you.The picture is also a bit grainy, use NeatImage (free) to enhance too.', '2006-05-31 21:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
