(2475368, 340045, 44611, '<td valign="top">I nearly went for this line, but felt that my image, as this one, looked too rural to fit into the suburban bit.  I like the infrared treatment though.</td>', 'I nearly went for this line, but felt that my image, as this one, looked too rural to fit into the suburban bit.  I like the infrared treatment though.', '2006-06-01 08:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2475375, 340729, 44611, '<td valign="top">Meter Maid?  Doesn''t look like any I''ve ever come across.  Surely she should have a uniform on?<br/> <br/>Great image though - I can''t fault the lighting and the pose is lovely.</td>', 'Meter Maid?  Doesn''t look like any I''ve ever come across.  Surely she should have a uniform on? Great image though - I can''t fault the lighting and the pose is lovely.', '2006-06-01 08:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
