(2476328, 340616, 6999, '<td valign="top">The luminosity/glow effect thing works very well for the sunlit grass, and perhaps for the sky between the leaves of the trees, but it seems to have had an odd effect on the pointing of that paving too. That light, and the sky visible, do not seem to belong to the same world, to my eye.</td>', 'The luminosity/glow effect thing works very well for the sunlit grass, and perhaps for the sky between the leaves of the trees, but it seems to have had an odd effect on the pointing of that paving too. That light, and the sky visible, do not seem to belong to the same world, to my eye.', '2006-06-01 15:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
