(2476579, 340530, 208, '<td valign="top">I sure hope that''s a weirdly painted wall in the background and not a horribly over-processed sky. As for the main subjects, the guys are nice and sharp and stand out beautifully from the background. Nice action capture!</td>', 'I sure hope that''s a weirdly painted wall in the background and not a horribly over-processed sky. As for the main subjects, the guys are nice and sharp and stand out beautifully from the background. Nice action capture!', '2006-06-01 17:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
