(2476593, 339171, 35444, '<td valign="top">Great idea and good execution, except it is a little too soft.  Too much neat image or noise ninja?  Or maybe just out of focus.</td>', 'Great idea and good execution, except it is a little too soft.  Too much neat image or noise ninja?  Or maybe just out of focus.', '2006-06-01 17:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2476607, 339732, 208, '<td valign="top">heh. Interesting take on a mantra not originally meant for Genesis. I like the shot overall, the girl pops nicely from the blurred/reflected background. I''d''ve picked another shirt for little Eve, though; it seems out of place for what you''re going after (even if I''m totally overthinking this).</td>', 'heh. Interesting take on a mantra not originally meant for Genesis. I like the shot overall, the girl pops nicely from the blurred/reflected background. I''d''ve picked another shirt for little Eve, though; it seems out of place for what you''re going after (even if I''m totally overthinking this).', '2006-06-01 17:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
