(2477681, 340203, 35947, '<td valign="top">I love the tech you used here.  It looks so dreamy and surreal.  I don''t think the signs on the tree adds anything though.  They''re more of a distraction/don''t fit.</td>', 'I love the tech you used here.  It looks so dreamy and surreal.  I don''t think the signs on the tree adds anything though.  They''re more of a distraction/don''t fit.', '2006-06-01 23:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477690, 338597, 35947, '<td valign="top">I''d love to drive your car!  Nice composition.  Only complaint is the reflections in the car.  Especially the big white truck on the front bumper.</td>', 'I''d love to drive your car!  Nice composition.  Only complaint is the reflections in the car.  Especially the big white truck on the front bumper.', '2006-06-02 00:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477692, 339919, 18799, '<td valign="top">Image is a very good social essay... about something. Fact is, I''m not sure what it''s saying.  What exactly is the mistake?  In any event, it''s an emotive picture from the standpoint that it made me linger and think about it.  8</td>', 'Image is a very good social essay... about something. Fact is, I''m not sure what it''s saying.  What exactly is the mistake?  In any event, it''s an emotive picture from the standpoint that it made me linger and think about it.  8', '2006-06-02 00:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
