(2477711, 340311, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice pic of the cat in the foreground.  The flash is harsh and creates distracting shadows.  The redeye on the cat in the background is not good.  5</td>', 'Nice pic of the cat in the foreground.  The flash is harsh and creates distracting shadows.  The redeye on the cat in the background is not good.  5', '2006-06-02 00:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
