(2477778, 340624, 18799, '<td valign="top">The expession on the ticket seller is priceless (and scary).  Good interpretation of the challenge.   8</td>', 'The expession on the ticket seller is priceless (and scary).  Good interpretation of the challenge.   8', '2006-06-02 00:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477782, 339423, 18799, '<td valign="top">I love the cottage!  The blurred butterfly in the foreground is a major distraction for me and I wish it wasn''t there.  6</td>', 'I love the cottage!  The blurred butterfly in the foreground is a major distraction for me and I wish it wasn''t there.  6', '2006-06-02 00:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477789, 340045, 52902, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2006-06-02 00:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477795, 340042, 18799, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this references the "...head in the cloud" part.  The image is not very compelling though.  It kind of flat, and well... boring.  Sorry.</td>', 'I''m guessing this references the "...head in the cloud" part.  The image is not very compelling though.  It kind of flat, and well... boring.  Sorry.', '2006-06-02 00:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477808, 340203, 18799, '<td valign="top">I''m a little confused by the meaning of this image.  The song lyrics go "there is a place where I can go"  The image suggests to me that there is a place where I CAN''T go.   6</td>', 'I''m a little confused by the meaning of this image.  The song lyrics go "there is a place where I can go"  The image suggests to me that there is a place where I CAN''T go.   6', '2006-06-02 00:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477815, 340211, 18799, '<td valign="top">I like the b/w conversion and I like that you include the lamp in the crop - it adds interest.   It appears that there is too much post processing such as neat image because the textures have a smeared look to them.   6</td>', 'I like the b/w conversion and I like that you include the lamp in the crop - it adds interest.   It appears that there is too much post processing such as neat image because the textures have a smeared look to them.   6', '2006-06-02 00:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477817, 340577, 59932, '<td valign="top">Great details in the dandelion!  I love what you''ve done with the toning down of the color saturation.  My only complaint here is that there''s not much detail in the bug - it blends right in with the background.</td>', 'Great details in the dandelion!  I love what you''ve done with the toning down of the color saturation.  My only complaint here is that there''s not much detail in the bug - it blends right in with the background.', '2006-06-02 00:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477824, 340316, 18799, '<td valign="top">I dunno, it doesn''t appear there is much "help" in this image.  Fun though.  6</td>', 'I dunno, it doesn''t appear there is much "help" in this image.  Fun though.  6', '2006-06-02 00:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477830, 340775, 59932, '<td valign="top">Great colors, great focus, great child portrait.  However, I fail to see the connection to your selected song/lyrics.  There are no visual cues linking him to nature, other than the fact that he''s outside.  His clothing and toy all seem, well, commercial.</td>', 'Great colors, great focus, great child portrait.  However, I fail to see the connection to your selected song/lyrics.  There are no visual cues linking him to nature, other than the fact that he''s outside.  His clothing and toy all seem, well, commercial.', '2006-06-02 00:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477841, 340482, 18799, '<td valign="top">I like all the vertical levels of interest in this image  7</td>', 'I like all the vertical levels of interest in this image  7', '2006-06-02 00:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477851, 340144, 18799, '<td valign="top">i get the connection, but the image should be larger.  It also looks a little muddy to me, a curves/contract boost would help.   5</td>', 'i get the connection, but the image should be larger.  It also looks a little muddy to me, a curves/contract boost would help.   5', '2006-06-02 00:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477852, 338714, 59932, '<td valign="top">Amazing details, color, and lighting!  They work well with the title, too.  <br/> <br/>My only suggestion here would be to burn in the bright left-hand side.  I think you need to keep it for the great compositional element of the curving branches, but it is slightly distracting from the rest of the photo.</td>', 'Amazing details, color, and lighting!  They work well with the title, too.   My only suggestion here would be to burn in the bright left-hand side.  I think you need to keep it for the great compositional element of the curving branches, but it is slightly distracting from the rest of the photo.', '2006-06-02 00:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477857, 338767, 59932, '<td valign="top">This interpretation is too funny.  Great catch.</td>', 'This interpretation is too funny.  Great catch.', '2006-06-02 00:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477864, 340620, 59932, '<td valign="top">I''m impressed that you were able to portray such specific / abstract lyrics in a literal manner!  I enjoy the use of negative space in the top left corner, and the subdued colors.</td>', 'I''m impressed that you were able to portray such specific / abstract lyrics in a literal manner!  I enjoy the use of negative space in the top left corner, and the subdued colors.', '2006-06-02 00:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
