(2478214, 340289, 42957, '<td valign="top">Cool lighting and excellent use of leading lines via the tile, but the cat is distracting.</td>', 'Cool lighting and excellent use of leading lines via the tile, but the cat is distracting.', '2006-06-02 02:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478218, 340724, 39007, '<td valign="top">Looks more like she''s leaving... I think her head should be in the bathroom and the feet out</td>', 'Looks more like she''s leaving... I think her head should be in the bathroom and the feet out', '2006-06-02 02:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478244, 340574, 39007, '<td valign="top">Rita?</td>', 'Rita?', '2006-06-02 02:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478249, 340534, 39007, '<td valign="top">I didn''t know The Beatles were an Icelandic group :P<br/> <br/>Striking image, my only niggle is that the figure is a bit androgenous in those clothes. If we could see her face or she was wearing something girlier it would be perfect - not that its far off!</td>', 'I didn''t know The Beatles were an Icelandic group :P Striking image, my only niggle is that the figure is a bit androgenous in those clothes. If we could see her face or she was wearing something girlier it would be perfect - not that its far off!', '2006-06-02 02:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478255, 340362, 39007, '<td valign="top">He looks forlorn - he crawled off to sleep in the bath...(Norwegian Wood) nicely done!</td>', 'He looks forlorn - he crawled off to sleep in the bath...(Norwegian Wood) nicely done!', '2006-06-02 03:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478256, 340496, 39007, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2006-06-02 03:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478258, 340308, 39007, '<td valign="top">As this was loading I''m thinking its a lovely picture, how will it tie in with the Beatles... well I love the title! Would have been much weaker if you''d gone for something like "lucy in the sky"<br/> <br/>I love the golden colouring its very pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'As this was loading I''m thinking its a lovely picture, how will it tie in with the Beatles... well I love the title! Would have been much weaker if you''d gone for something like "lucy in the sky" I love the golden colouring its very pleasing to the eye.', '2006-06-02 03:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478259, 340411, 39007, '<td valign="top">I think the Beatles would have liked this as much as I do :-)</td>', 'I think the Beatles would have liked this as much as I do :-)', '2006-06-02 03:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478260, 340697, 39007, '<td valign="top">Just enough contrast that the frog is visible - and very well captured.</td>', 'Just enough contrast that the frog is visible - and very well captured.', '2006-06-02 03:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478264, 340283, 39007, '<td valign="top">A striking image!</td>', 'A striking image!', '2006-06-02 03:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478273, 339467, 23430, '<td valign="top">Very effective. Perfectly done.</td>', 'Very effective. Perfectly done.', '2006-06-02 03:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478285, 340051, 23430, '<td valign="top">Fun shot. You''ve caught the bubbles well which is not always easy. The smile and position of the hands on the baby look great. Technically speaking there is a bit of blur or soft focus in some areas toward the front which would have been better if they were as sharp as the adult''s arm. Maybe to avoid chopping off the kid''s shoe might help more too.</td>', 'Fun shot. You''ve caught the bubbles well which is not always easy. The smile and position of the hands on the baby look great. Technically speaking there is a bit of blur or soft focus in some areas toward the front which would have been better if they were as sharp as the adult''s arm. Maybe to avoid chopping off the kid''s shoe might help more too.', '2006-06-02 03:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478286, 340287, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great light to bring out those smooth skin tones. Nice expressions. Good crop.</td>', 'Great light to bring out those smooth skin tones. Nice expressions. Good crop.', '2006-06-02 03:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478300, 339423, 23430, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to get a big DOF with the fast shutter speed required for this shot. It may have looked better going for focus on the butterfly and going for soft focus on the house. It''s still pretty good and the composition of the house, path and lawn is good.</td>', 'It''s hard to get a big DOF with the fast shutter speed required for this shot. It may have looked better going for focus on the butterfly and going for soft focus on the house. It''s still pretty good and the composition of the house, path and lawn is good.', '2006-06-02 03:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478303, 340151, 23430, '<td valign="top">Good composition going for the close crop and getting the gun in. The harsh overhead sun here helps the mean look a bit too. Cigarette is an added bonus. Well done.</td>', 'Good composition going for the close crop and getting the gun in. The harsh overhead sun here helps the mean look a bit too. Cigarette is an added bonus. Well done.', '2006-06-02 03:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478314, 338714, 4226, '<td valign="top">I like the over saturated colors here</td>', 'I like the over saturated colors here', '2006-06-02 04:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478328, 340262, 45003, '<td valign="top">I like it. I think it would look better if you saturated the colors a bit more.</td>', 'I like it. I think it would look better if you saturated the colors a bit more.', '2006-06-02 04:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478331, 340554, 45003, '<td valign="top">Most of the time I don''t like photos with black and white and one coloured thing, but sometimes I do. Like this one. Excellent shot.</td>', 'Most of the time I don''t like photos with black and white and one coloured thing, but sometimes I do. Like this one. Excellent shot.', '2006-06-02 04:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
