(2479293, 339946, 56948, '<td valign="top">weird. very very cool, but weird.</td>', 'weird. very very cool, but weird.', '2006-06-02 15:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479303, 340196, 6999, '<td valign="top">Whilst it''s perfectly fitting for the challenge, the main problem this image suffers from is the simple quality of light when you took it. It''s clearly country accustomed to intense heat, but that very over-head sun doesn''t do anything to really illuminate this landscape - it simply makes it visible. At a later time of day, the more sloping light would cast shadows on those contours that would make the shapes of the landscape more understandable in a photograph - it''s a shadows that enable us to determine the shapes of things, and in this light, there are none.</td>', 'Whilst it''s perfectly fitting for the challenge, the main problem this image suffers from is the simple quality of light when you took it. It''s clearly country accustomed to intense heat, but that very over-head sun doesn''t do anything to really illuminate this landscape - it simply makes it visible. At a later time of day, the more sloping light would cast shadows on those contours that would make the shapes of the landscape more understandable in a photograph - it''s a shadows that enable us to determine the shapes of things, and in this light, there are none.', '2006-06-02 15:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479326, 339815, 6999, '<td valign="top">It''s difficult to say that there''s anything actually wrong with this per se - but it isn''t an appealing image, nevertheless. The total isolation of tha black background is very well done, but it really exposes any composition to close scrutiny, and this doesn''t work for me: the two diagonals suggested by the shoes conflict quite a bit - being neither symmetrical nor off-centred, but somewhere between; the light, for me, is too flat to really show details of the textures that would speak of batteredness - I think that''s simply the use of too much fill light - rather than the usual problem of direct flash - so that the shadows are wiped out rather more than would really be effective.</td>', 'It''s difficult to say that there''s anything actually wrong with this per se - but it isn''t an appealing image, nevertheless. The total isolation of tha black background is very well done, but it really exposes any composition to close scrutiny, and this doesn''t work for me: the two diagonals suggested by the shoes conflict quite a bit - being neither symmetrical nor off-centred, but somewhere between; the light, for me, is too flat to really show details of the textures that would speak of batteredness - I think that''s simply the use of too much fill light - rather than the usual problem of direct flash - so that the shadows are wiped out rather more than would really be effective.', '2006-06-02 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479347, 340455, 11899, '<td valign="top">For a Beatles Song/Lyrics challenge?  Nice photo though.</td>', 'For a Beatles Song/Lyrics challenge?  Nice photo though.', '2006-06-02 15:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479351, 339927, 6999, '<td valign="top">This is an idea I like, although i think the execution really has problems - it looks straight-from-camera, and lacks a great deal of definition, and certainly of contrast, and is dark. I''d brighten it, raise the black level to return the shadows, and certainly convert it to black and white - what colour information there is here, is badly off and very green. In bringing that definition to her face, you''d probably find some of the highlights in the reflections would burn out, but as the real point of this image is that face, that wouldn''t be an issue really - it would add to the ''street'' sense of the image.</td>', 'This is an idea I like, although i think the execution really has problems - it looks straight-from-camera, and lacks a great deal of definition, and certainly of contrast, and is dark. I''d brighten it, raise the black level to return the shadows, and certainly convert it to black and white - what colour information there is here, is badly off and very green. In bringing that definition to her face, you''d probably find some of the highlights in the reflections would burn out, but as the real point of this image is that face, that wouldn''t be an issue really - it would add to the ''street'' sense of the image.', '2006-06-02 15:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479363, 339931, 11899, '<td valign="top">Striking photo - something of a stretch for the Beatles connection though.</td>', 'Striking photo - something of a stretch for the Beatles connection though.', '2006-06-02 16:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479365, 340135, 40370, '<td valign="top">This convey''s mother nature''s son as industry, I like that concept. Nice composition, only complaint is the water is a little brown looking rather than sea green or blue. bump</td>', 'This convey''s mother nature''s son as industry, I like that concept. Nice composition, only complaint is the water is a little brown looking rather than sea green or blue. bump', '2006-06-02 16:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
