(2479427, 339285, 24454, '<td valign="top">Perfect! This is so creative, and so pretty!  I love it.</td>', 'Perfect! This is so creative, and so pretty!  I love it.', '2006-06-02 16:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479430, 340135, 6999, '<td valign="top">As a landscape I like this - the great DOF is effective, adding an element of graphic interest as well as simply the view. The contrail in the sky - the vertical one - works slightly clumsily against the effect of the rest of the lines in the shot, perhaps. Fine tonality, though a little judicious shading might have helped emphasise your subject for the DPC voters.</td>', 'As a landscape I like this - the great DOF is effective, adding an element of graphic interest as well as simply the view. The contrail in the sky - the vertical one - works slightly clumsily against the effect of the rest of the lines in the shot, perhaps. Fine tonality, though a little judicious shading might have helped emphasise your subject for the DPC voters.', '2006-06-02 16:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479431, 340631, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this close composition!  This is awesome.</td>', 'I love this close composition!  This is awesome.', '2006-06-02 16:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479438, 340603, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like the graphic lines and the contrasty quality of the light on the leaves - I''m less sure about the over-done arrangement of strawberries bottom left. I think I''d have believed they werer strawberry plants without that - and there''s an incongruity about these berries collected with a bunch of not-in-fruit plants.</td>', 'I like the graphic lines and the contrasty quality of the light on the leaves - I''m less sure about the over-done arrangement of strawberries bottom left. I think I''d have believed they werer strawberry plants without that - and there''s an incongruity about these berries collected with a bunch of not-in-fruit plants.', '2006-06-02 16:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479440, 340578, 24454, '<td valign="top">I wonder if this is an Icelandic hill!   It has that wonderful, dramatic sky like the Icelandic pictures do!  Absolutely stunning!</td>', 'I wonder if this is an Icelandic hill!   It has that wonderful, dramatic sky like the Icelandic pictures do!  Absolutely stunning!', '2006-06-02 16:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
