(2480153, 340578, 18197, '<td valign="top">Dramatic framing adds a lot of interest to the shot. The figure is stiff and doesn''t really convey the notion your title suggests. Is that an action figure (with a Kung Fu grip?). I gave this a good score but a livlier subject would have had an extra point or two from me.</td>', 'Dramatic framing adds a lot of interest to the shot. The figure is stiff and doesn''t really convey the notion your title suggests. Is that an action figure (with a Kung Fu grip?). I gave this a good score but a livlier subject would have had an extra point or two from me.', '2006-06-02 20:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2480170, 340597, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. I always thought Taste of Honey was a Herb Alpert song but I''m willing to give it the benefit of the doubt. Well composed. Nice tones and reflections. Very effective DOF. Among my favorites.</td>', 'Very nice image. I always thought Taste of Honey was a Herb Alpert song but I''m willing to give it the benefit of the doubt. Well composed. Nice tones and reflections. Very effective DOF. Among my favorites.', '2006-06-02 21:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2480171, 338709, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic sky! Lovely colors. Depending on what was there, I might have liked to see a bit more of the foreground. Unless of course there were pawn shops and paycheck loan places. Well done. Among my favorites!</td>', 'Very dramatic sky! Lovely colors. Depending on what was there, I might have liked to see a bit more of the foreground. Unless of course there were pawn shops and paycheck loan places. Well done. Among my favorites!', '2006-06-02 21:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
