(2480200, 339150, 18197, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really meet the challenge. I can''t remember a Beatles lyric refering to a yellow taxicab. That aside, this would have been a better photo in my opinion if there weren''t blown highlights. There is an imbalance between the top third of the photo which is mostly dark and the bottom which is mostly bright. It would be okay if the darks weren''t quite so dark (just my opinion). I am unable to see detail in the grill which I would like to see. And if it were me, I would have hosed the car off to get rid the gradoo. In the end, it feels flat to me.</td>', 'Doesn''t really meet the challenge. I can''t remember a Beatles lyric refering to a yellow taxicab. That aside, this would have been a better photo in my opinion if there weren''t blown highlights. There is an imbalance between the top third of the photo which is mostly dark and the bottom which is mostly bright. It would be okay if the darks weren''t quite so dark (just my opinion). I am unable to see detail in the grill which I would like to see. And if it were me, I would have hosed the car off to get rid the gradoo. In the end, it feels flat to me.', '2006-06-02 21:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
