(2482876, 340262, 19831, '<td valign="top">I like your minimalist approach to this shot. It has a good interest factor. Colors look pretty good. Although sometimes breaking the ''rule'' and centering a horizon can work, I just don''t think it is helping this image being centered. I think if you had placed the horizon either closer to the top or bottom, it could strengthen the presentation here, and play even stronger to the mimimalist theme of the shot.</td>', 'I like your minimalist approach to this shot. It has a good interest factor. Colors look pretty good. Although sometimes breaking the ''rule'' and centering a horizon can work, I just don''t think it is helping this image being centered. I think if you had placed the horizon either closer to the top or bottom, it could strengthen the presentation here, and play even stronger to the mimimalist theme of the shot.', '2006-06-04 03:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2482879, 340182, 19831, '<td valign="top">Really cool use of blur. I''m not sure why, but the bike is a nice touch. Somehow it really adds to the shot, IMO.</td>', 'Really cool use of blur. I''m not sure why, but the bike is a nice touch. Somehow it really adds to the shot, IMO.', '2006-06-04 03:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2482883, 339171, 19831, '<td valign="top">hehe, neat idea :-) Great colors and composed nicely. I think the focus could be a little sharper. Another thing that seems to be working against this great concept, is the blown out highlights out the window from the bright sunlight. Might be better in such a situation, if possible, to try a different time of day, to make it easier to nail the exposure.</td>', 'hehe, neat idea :-) Great colors and composed nicely. I think the focus could be a little sharper. Another thing that seems to be working against this great concept, is the blown out highlights out the window from the bright sunlight. Might be better in such a situation, if possible, to try a different time of day, to make it easier to nail the exposure.', '2006-06-04 03:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2482884, 340166, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. Great pov, and I really like your treatment of it. Nice job.</td>', 'Very cool shot. Great pov, and I really like your treatment of it. Nice job.', '2006-06-04 03:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2482886, 339705, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. Interesting lighting, and great subtle use of leading lines. NIce job.</td>', 'Very cool shot. Interesting lighting, and great subtle use of leading lines. NIce job.', '2006-06-04 03:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2482888, 340666, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cute photo! and executed very well. This gave me a very much needed smile, so thank-you and a high score from me :-)</td>', 'Very cute photo! and executed very well. This gave me a very much needed smile, so thank-you and a high score from me :-)', '2006-06-04 03:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
