(2483113, 340449, 35602, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful interpretation of one of my favorites.  I think you have captured the essence of this song with this pic.  Technically, the face is a bit too shadowed and the shirt is overexposed, but if those items could have been adjusted at the time of the shot with maybe a different light or a filter to even out the highlights and darks, this would have been a hard one to beat.</td>', 'This is a wonderful interpretation of one of my favorites.  I think you have captured the essence of this song with this pic.  Technically, the face is a bit too shadowed and the shirt is overexposed, but if those items could have been adjusted at the time of the shot with maybe a different light or a filter to even out the highlights and darks, this would have been a hard one to beat.', '2006-06-04 08:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
