(2485683, 339635, 44611, '<td valign="top">I think you had a great idea here and I like the way you''ve captured the honey pouring into the glass.  It would be good to see the whole glass though.</td>', 'I think you had a great idea here and I like the way you''ve captured the honey pouring into the glass.  It would be good to see the whole glass though.', '2006-06-05 05:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
