(2485690, 340603, 44611, '<td valign="top">This could have been brilliant - but I think you''ve over done it with the strawberries.  Those in the foreground (not in the glass look really out of place.  The ones in the glass are great - and I love the reflection, but it''s lost with those other strawberries obscuring part of it.</td>', 'This could have been brilliant - but I think you''ve over done it with the strawberries.  Those in the foreground (not in the glass look really out of place.  The ones in the glass are great - and I love the reflection, but it''s lost with those other strawberries obscuring part of it.', '2006-06-05 05:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
