(2486314, 339422, 4967, '<td valign="top">I think you did an excellent job here... especailly with your DOF being perfect so that you can still see her real face in the mirror, and I like the haloing that the back lighting creates in keeping with the song and the fact she works at a church.  Nicely done. -10-</td>', 'I think you did an excellent job here... especailly with your DOF being perfect so that you can still see her real face in the mirror, and I like the haloing that the back lighting creates in keeping with the song and the fact she works at a church.  Nicely done. -10-', '2006-06-05 11:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2486316, 340450, 16402, '<td valign="top">Cute and clever. Little softer light might have worked better but still a good job.</td>', 'Cute and clever. Little softer light might have worked better but still a good job.', '2006-06-05 11:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2486320, 340483, 4967, '<td valign="top">You picked a good subject in bad lighting conditions.  It''s important when you are doing a portrait (even candid) of just a single person that you really watch your background... also I''m feeling that you might have gotten a more interesting moment from this guy.  I''m guessing the group were playing for a while?  How many shots did you take?</td>', 'You picked a good subject in bad lighting conditions.  It''s important when you are doing a portrait (even candid) of just a single person that you really watch your background... also I''m feeling that you might have gotten a more interesting moment from this guy.  I''m guessing the group were playing for a while?  How many shots did you take?', '2006-06-05 11:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2486325, 340419, 16402, '<td valign="top">Lighting''s a bit harsh and focus seems just a little off.</td>', 'Lighting''s a bit harsh and focus seems just a little off.', '2006-06-05 11:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2486326, 340554, 4967, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice to use an apple.  I''d be interested in hearing why?  Is it in the lyrics?  I can''t seem to remember that... I might have leaned towards a silver spoon perhaps.  Also why is there an apple in the bathroom?  I''m really not seeing your meaning in this photo.</td>', 'Interesting choice to use an apple.  I''d be interested in hearing why?  Is it in the lyrics?  I can''t seem to remember that... I might have leaned towards a silver spoon perhaps.  Also why is there an apple in the bathroom?  I''m really not seeing your meaning in this photo.', '2006-06-05 11:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2486328, 340305, 16402, '<td valign="top">I like that you got the moon in.</td>', 'I like that you got the moon in.', '2006-06-05 11:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2486330, 340499, 16402, '<td valign="top">It''s got a weird (green) color cast.</td>', 'It''s got a weird (green) color cast.', '2006-06-05 11:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2486334, 340749, 16402, '<td valign="top">Like the overall concept and I like the noise, but the odd angle really doesn''t add anything to it.</td>', 'Like the overall concept and I like the noise, but the odd angle really doesn''t add anything to it.', '2006-06-05 11:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2486335, 340303, 4967, '<td valign="top">A couple of things I notice here... one - the electrical box or whatever it is that is coming out of her knee is quite disturbing 2 - while I love the chipped pain next to her - the plain white, modern door detracts from the scene, and 3 - I think this would have served better as a much closer portrait - it looks like your model has wondeerful eyes... but why not focus on them?  Especially because of your title?! Get in close... you''ve got a great model, don''t let a busy scene detract from her.</td>', 'A couple of things I notice here... one - the electrical box or whatever it is that is coming out of her knee is quite disturbing 2 - while I love the chipped pain next to her - the plain white, modern door detracts from the scene, and 3 - I think this would have served better as a much closer portrait - it looks like your model has wondeerful eyes... but why not focus on them?  Especially because of your title?! Get in close... you''ve got a great model, don''t let a busy scene detract from her.', '2006-06-05 11:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2486339, 338792, 16402, '<td valign="top">While this techically is not a bad photo (may a bit dark), there is nothing at all here that says "strawberries" to me, sorry.</td>', 'While this techically is not a bad photo (may a bit dark), there is nothing at all here that says "strawberries" to me, sorry.', '2006-06-05 11:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2486343, 338910, 16402, '<td valign="top">Too dark</td>', 'Too dark', '2006-06-05 11:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2486344, 339661, 4967, '<td valign="top">I like the grittiness of this photo - it seems very purposeful and appropriate... what I don''t care for is the fact that you choose (either in camera or in photoshop) to crop out the feet of this man - especially almost right at his ankles.  One lesson I''ve learned in photojournalism and from listening to the pros is that if you have to cut out limbs/body parts, don''t do it right at the joint.  I wish I could see the feet and the yellow boots, I think it would add to the photo.  Anyway... -8-</td>', 'I like the grittiness of this photo - it seems very purposeful and appropriate... what I don''t care for is the fact that you choose (either in camera or in photoshop) to crop out the feet of this man - especially almost right at his ankles.  One lesson I''ve learned in photojournalism and from listening to the pros is that if you have to cut out limbs/body parts, don''t do it right at the joint.  I wish I could see the feet and the yellow boots, I think it would add to the photo.  Anyway... -8-', '2006-06-05 11:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2486347, 339748, 16402, '<td valign="top">Creative approach. I like the implied reach for her hand instead of the boring, cliche shot of hands together.</td>', 'Creative approach. I like the implied reach for her hand instead of the boring, cliche shot of hands together.', '2006-06-05 11:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2486356, 340411, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting photo... but I''m sure you are hearing that a lot :-) I like how the man and the back wall seem to almost be in different dimensions in terms of color - very intense.  Why the choice to make the umbrella be turned inside out?  Anyway, I really like this photo - nicely done, great placing and use of rule of thirds - 10 -</td>', 'This is a very interesting photo... but I''m sure you are hearing that a lot :-) I like how the man and the back wall seem to almost be in different dimensions in terms of color - very intense.  Why the choice to make the umbrella be turned inside out?  Anyway, I really like this photo - nicely done, great placing and use of rule of thirds - 10 -', '2006-06-05 11:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2486358, 340697, 4967, '<td valign="top">Awesome :-).  How many people have missed that little guy?  Nature is truly incredible!  nice use of the rule of thirds and a very nice fairly abstract photo.  -9-</td>', 'Awesome :-).  How many people have missed that little guy?  Nature is truly incredible!  nice use of the rule of thirds and a very nice fairly abstract photo.  -9-', '2006-06-05 11:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2486367, 340501, 4967, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!  Excellent interpretation of the challenge... and great job giving you the perspective of the other person with their hand on the cup!  My only quip might be that I might have liked to have seen this with a slightly less busy background... especially the edge of the wall coming right out of the person''s head is somewhat disturbind.  Great job though and use of photographic techniques to really give a sense of the song title. -9-</td>', 'Very nicely done!  Excellent interpretation of the challenge... and great job giving you the perspective of the other person with their hand on the cup!  My only quip might be that I might have liked to have seen this with a slightly less busy background... especially the edge of the wall coming right out of the person''s head is somewhat disturbind.  Great job though and use of photographic techniques to really give a sense of the song title. -9-', '2006-06-05 12:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2486384, 340534, 4967, '<td valign="top">I like this in terms of place and placement.  Very nicely done.  Great exposure and awesome colors.  Thanks for not just having a random girl standing in a random place, but for still making it an awesome photo!  -10-</td>', 'I like this in terms of place and placement.  Very nicely done.  Great exposure and awesome colors.  Thanks for not just having a random girl standing in a random place, but for still making it an awesome photo!  -10-', '2006-06-05 12:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
