(2487253, 340413, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!  Love the tonality.  Wish you would have taken it a little later or earlier in the day so that the sky and background weren''t so overexposed.  Also it looks like the further back girl is holding something in her hand but I don''t think she is.  A trick of the perspective.  Nice job.<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nicely done!  Love the tonality.  Wish you would have taken it a little later or earlier in the day so that the sky and background weren''t so overexposed.  Also it looks like the further back girl is holding something in her hand but I don''t think she is.  A trick of the perspective.  Nice job.TC', '2006-06-05 18:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2487265, 340196, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge, but the shot needs something to really make it pop.  Perhaps if your sky weren''t so bald headed...<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge, but the shot needs something to really make it pop.  Perhaps if your sky weren''t so bald headed...TC', '2006-06-05 18:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
