(2487803, 338643, 41800, '<td valign="top">more appropriate title "The Sky" cuz I don''t see Lucy or diamonds. kidding aside, the sky is quite average.It lacks any dramatic effect. the foreground is dark and shadowy. Perhaps if this shot were taken in a different direction or time the foreground would be better lit giving more detail. It would also change the light spectrum somewhat perhaps giving a better tonal quality in the sky</td>', 'more appropriate title "The Sky" cuz I don''t see Lucy or diamonds. kidding aside, the sky is quite average.It lacks any dramatic effect. the foreground is dark and shadowy. Perhaps if this shot were taken in a different direction or time the foreground would be better lit giving more detail. It would also change the light spectrum somewhat perhaps giving a better tonal quality in the sky', '2006-06-05 21:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
