(2489879, 339931, 24499, '<td valign="top">As a 44 year Beatles fan, I knew every song referenced in all the entries, so I was really looking for one that jumped out.  This one did.  I think the dogs are distracting and would have liked to have them out of the picture.  I don''t know whether this was a planned shot or target of opportunity, but it would also have been cleaner to not have the tree under the horse''s front leg, though the silouhette is distinct enough that that''s not a major problem.  The peek of sun through the rider''s hair is great.  Unless the horse is a statue, that had to be fortuitous (or 300 shots till you got it just right). But dogs and tree aside, the horse and rider jump out, and that''s the "ticket".  10</td>', 'As a 44 year Beatles fan, I knew every song referenced in all the entries, so I was really looking for one that jumped out.  This one did.  I think the dogs are distracting and would have liked to have them out of the picture.  I don''t know whether this was a planned shot or target of opportunity, but it would also have been cleaner to not have the tree under the horse''s front leg, though the silouhette is distinct enough that that''s not a major problem.  The peek of sun through the rider''s hair is great.  Unless the horse is a statue, that had to be fortuitous (or 300 shots till you got it just right). But dogs and tree aside, the horse and rider jump out, and that''s the "ticket".  10', '2006-06-06 11:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2489898, 340196, 34194, '<td valign="top">I like the image and the angle, the saturation probably a tad over done. Which one of you Utahans shot this?</td>', 'I like the image and the angle, the saturation probably a tad over done. Which one of you Utahans shot this?', '2006-06-06 11:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
