(2490959, 340011, 36076, '<td valign="top">a stunning creature and a clever lyric choice. i love the detail and the texture of the feathers. elegant lines. the close crop makes for good composition. simply lovely. the only bad thing i can possibly think of is that i wish the legs were as sharp as the rest of the image.</td>', 'a stunning creature and a clever lyric choice. i love the detail and the texture of the feathers. elegant lines. the close crop makes for good composition. simply lovely. the only bad thing i can possibly think of is that i wish the legs were as sharp as the rest of the image.', '2006-06-06 17:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2490961, 339128, 36076, '<td valign="top">gorgeous sene. love that we can see the rocks through the water. the mountains are beautiful of course and i think the stormy sky adds to the feel of the shot. great colors and i like the cloud shadows on the hills.</td>', 'gorgeous sene. love that we can see the rocks through the water. the mountains are beautiful of course and i think the stormy sky adds to the feel of the shot. great colors and i like the cloud shadows on the hills.', '2006-06-06 17:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2490964, 338829, 36076, '<td valign="top">i really love your take on the challenge. great image for the lyric and it LOOKS like a part of a music video. i love the lines of the lot and how tiny the person looks. i wish the person was a little further down in the composition (i missed them at first glance) and b/w may add to this shot. otherwise great!</td>', 'i really love your take on the challenge. great image for the lyric and it LOOKS like a part of a music video. i love the lines of the lot and how tiny the person looks. i wish the person was a little further down in the composition (i missed them at first glance) and b/w may add to this shot. otherwise great!', '2006-06-06 17:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
