(2491384, 340454, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Love the feeling of sneakiness brought to it by the inclusion of that girder; and I always felt there was a certain soi-disant elegance to ER too.<br/> <br/>Returning: it''s stayed in my mind, this shot, so I''m just knocking you up that one remaining point. One of the two genuinely fascinating images in this challenge.</td>', 'Nice shot. Love the feeling of sneakiness brought to it by the inclusion of that girder; and I always felt there was a certain soi-disant elegance to ER too. Returning: it''s stayed in my mind, this shot, so I''m just knocking you up that one remaining point. One of the two genuinely fascinating images in this challenge.', '2006-06-06 19:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2491388, 340624, 6999, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photography - Erwitt-esque, and there''s no higher compliment from me. The crop might be a little tight, really, but that''s all. Bravo. And she looks so damn miserable - the greatest saleswoman on earth ;-)</td>', 'Gorgeous photography - Erwitt-esque, and there''s no higher compliment from me. The crop might be a little tight, really, but that''s all. Bravo. And she looks so damn miserable - the greatest saleswoman on earth ;-)', '2006-06-06 19:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2491392, 340755, 9906, '<td valign="top">Of all the sun shots, this one is the best one so far!  Very nice dramatic sky.  I''ve had conversations in the forums about the luck factor in photography and got laughed at but this, to me, proves that there is such a factor...<br/>TC</td>', 'Of all the sun shots, this one is the best one so far!  Very nice dramatic sky.  I''ve had conversations in the forums about the luck factor in photography and got laughed at but this, to me, proves that there is such a factor...TC', '2006-06-06 20:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2491393, 340483, 9906, '<td valign="top">This, to me, doesn''t look like the title would imply...  Photo wise, it looks like horribly difficult lighting.  Did you use any flash?  I think it would have helped to bring out his features.<br/>TC</td>', 'This, to me, doesn''t look like the title would imply...  Photo wise, it looks like horribly difficult lighting.  Did you use any flash?  I think it would have helped to bring out his features.TC', '2006-06-06 20:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2491402, 340597, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Great bokeh.  Perfect lighting and focus.  Good job<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nice!  Great bokeh.  Perfect lighting and focus.  Good jobTC', '2006-06-06 20:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2491405, 340144, 9906, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is very small and thus hard to comment on properly...  There is a tutorial on how to resize for DPC in the learn/tutorial section.<br/>TC</td>', 'Wow, this is very small and thus hard to comment on properly...  There is a tutorial on how to resize for DPC in the learn/tutorial section.TC', '2006-06-06 20:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
