(2491463, 338603, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot with nice light, but it''s a bit small...  There''s a tutorial on resizing for DPC in the Learn section.  Hope it helps.<br/>TC</td>', 'This is an interesting shot with nice light, but it''s a bit small...  There''s a tutorial on resizing for DPC in the Learn section.  Hope it helps.TC', '2006-06-06 20:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2491465, 339661, 11653, '<td valign="top">Great detail, lots of interesting details that support the subject very well</td>', 'Great detail, lots of interesting details that support the subject very well', '2006-06-06 20:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2491467, 340538, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is (I''m sorry to say) just not an attractive shot.  The lighting is extremely harsh which causes extreme contrasts.  If shooting outdoors, it''s always best to shoot a couple hours after sunrise or a couple hours before sunset.  You get the best light (softer contrasts), less harsh shadows and better color tones.<br/>TC</td>', 'This is (I''m sorry to say) just not an attractive shot.  The lighting is extremely harsh which causes extreme contrasts.  If shooting outdoors, it''s always best to shoot a couple hours after sunrise or a couple hours before sunset.  You get the best light (softer contrasts), less harsh shadows and better color tones.TC', '2006-06-06 20:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2491475, 340582, 11653, '<td valign="top">I think cropping more off the left side would improve this. I really like the tone and light in this. Especially on her hands and face.</td>', 'I think cropping more off the left side would improve this. I really like the tone and light in this. Especially on her hands and face.', '2006-06-06 20:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
