(2492537, 340353, 58047, '<td valign="top">Thanks Everyone, I thought I''d give you a little background to the shot. I joined DPChallenge a week or so before I went to Fiji for a holiday, on my return (after taking 6000 photos) I found the Beatles Challenge and recalled this shot of was is almost a submarine, I thought it was close enough to sumbit as my opening to the challenge. I wasn''t expected much vote why, and infact I think I faired better then the shot deserves. <br/>The actual vessel is called a Semi-Sub, there is a large glass viewing platform below that allows tourist a fish eye view of the coral and sealife, it was taken onboard a small tinny that was ferrying us to a nearby island.</td>', 'Thanks Everyone, I thought I''d give you a little background to the shot. I joined DPChallenge a week or so before I went to Fiji for a holiday, on my return (after taking 6000 photos) I found the Beatles Challenge and recalled this shot of was is almost a submarine, I thought it was close enough to sumbit as my opening to the challenge. I wasn''t expected much vote why, and infact I think I faired better then the shot deserves. The actual vessel is called a Semi-Sub, there is a large glass viewing platform below that allows tourist a fish eye view of the coral and sealife, it was taken onboard a small tinny that was ferrying us to a nearby island.', '2006-06-07 01:38:21.000000', NULL, 0),
