(2493230, 340576, 41746, '<td valign="top">I regret not reading the rules precisely. My mistake. However, this does not take away the pride I have for this photo. It was made from a single photo and is my expression of I, Me, Mine. Thanks to you who commented before the DQ.</td>', 'I regret not reading the rules precisely. My mistake. However, this does not take away the pride I have for this photo. It was made from a single photo and is my expression of I, Me, Mine. Thanks to you who commented before the DQ.', '2006-06-07 04:10:10.000000', NULL, 0),
