(2493243, 340303, 18450, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club. <br/> <br/>Hi Jon, <br/> <br/>First impressions are ...I really like this shot. The colours and lighting on your beautiful model are lovely, her pose has a wonderfully fluid and sensual feel to it. Point of view, perspective appeals to me...fits the music.<br/> <br/>I do agree with some of your comments about the busy b/g, meter next to her knees being distracting.....I wonder if a shallower dof, background oof would have thrown the focus directly onto her eyes. <br/> <br/>I think I might have tried a further slight levels adjustment moving the white slider to 0/1.0/222, it seems to bring out more detail in her eyes and face. Good work on the composition of this shot.....it really is different, vibrant! <br/> <br/>I grew up with the Beetles too....this shot really does fit the challenge very well, fits the mood of the time. <br/> <br/>I''ll look forward to seeing more of your work in forthcoming challenges<br/> <br/>sue</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club.  Hi Jon,  First impressions are ...I really like this shot. The colours and lighting on your beautiful model are lovely, her pose has a wonderfully fluid and sensual feel to it. Point of view, perspective appeals to me...fits the music. I do agree with some of your comments about the busy b/g, meter next to her knees being distracting.....I wonder if a shallower dof, background oof would have thrown the focus directly onto her eyes.  I think I might have tried a further slight levels adjustment moving the white slider to 0/1.0/222, it seems to bring out more detail in her eyes and face. Good work on the composition of this shot.....it really is different, vibrant!  I grew up with the Beetles too....this shot really does fit the challenge very well, fits the mood of the time.  I''ll look forward to seeing more of your work in forthcoming challenges sue', '2006-06-07 04:20:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2493248, 340255, 20168, '<td valign="top">Great entry Perry! This would have done well in the current "framing" contest! Look forward to seeing you back on the coast! Way to edge in front of zoomy!</td>', 'Great entry Perry! This would have done well in the current "framing" contest! Look forward to seeing you back on the coast! Way to edge in front of zoomy!', '2006-06-07 04:25:44.000000', NULL, 0),
