(2493321, 339661, 35322, '<td valign="top">Hi everybody, <br/>Thanks for the comments. <br/>I recieved some comments saying that I shouldn''t have cut the feet off....and I agree. But I had no choice. In the original image, the right foot is in full sun, thus completly blown out, and even with advanced editing I was not able to redo his foot (I am still noy good at that yet). Here''s the <a href="//i81.photobucket.com/albums/j216/photobia/original.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">original</a>.<br/>Cheers,<br/>Bianca</td>', 'Hi everybody, Thanks for the comments. I recieved some comments saying that I shouldn''t have cut the feet off....and I agree. But I had no choice. In the original image, the right foot is in full sun, thus completly blown out, and even with advanced editing I was not able to redo his foot (I am still noy good at that yet). Here''s the original.Cheers,Bianca', '2006-06-07 05:23:39.000000', NULL, 0),
