(2493338, 339927, 59361, '<td valign="top"><br/>thanks all, for your comments :)<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by san62910:</b></div><hr/><i> Excellent.  I want to read your comments after the challenge to see how you shot this. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>i placed myself around a corner near where the cars stop, and took pictures of people<br/>that look in their thoughts through their windows ... this woman was in a cab,  ... hence the reflections and the colors that i thought was perfect for the mood ....</td>', 'thanks all, for your comments :) Originally posted by san62910: Excellent.  I want to read your comments after the challenge to see how you shot this.   i placed myself around a corner near where the cars stop, and took pictures of peoplethat look in their thoughts through their windows ... this woman was in a cab,  ... hence the reflections and the colors that i thought was perfect for the mood ....', '2006-06-07 05:32:00.000000', NULL, 0),
