(2494041, 340203, 34194, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by naldslc:</b></div><hr/><i> Chris! Nice shot my man, it''s too bad people can''t find the message you were trying to achieve here. I did, and it''s a powerful one. Well done my friend! </i></td></tr></table> Thanks for the positive thoughts Steve, I appreciate the positive reinforcement. All too often it seems that these challenges are taken far too literally. I was happy with the quality and feel of this image. I''ll keep plugging away and maybe get a shot one of these days that appeals to the masses.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-07 09:06:51.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by naldslc: Chris! Nice shot my man, it''s too bad people can''t find the message you were trying to achieve here. I did, and it''s a powerful one. Well done my friend!  Thanks for the positive thoughts Steve, I appreciate the positive reinforcement. All too often it seems that these challenges are taken far too literally. I was happy with the quality and feel of this image. I''ll keep plugging away and maybe get a shot one of these days that appeals to the masses.', '2006-06-07 10:04:45.000000', '2006-06-07 10:06:51.000000', 0),
