(2494573, 339857, 52336, '<td valign="top">Great picture. :)  I really like how they''re lined up, facing each side of the frame.  Great capture.  I like the colour treatment, and the way their mouths pop out of the image (literally too I suppose).  Overall the tone seems uniform, and I think a flash head that you could bounce around would really have improved the lighting.  Really great overall.</td>', 'Great picture. :)  I really like how they''re lined up, facing each side of the frame.  Great capture.  I like the colour treatment, and the way their mouths pop out of the image (literally too I suppose).  Overall the tone seems uniform, and I think a flash head that you could bounce around would really have improved the lighting.  Really great overall.', '2006-06-07 12:36:29.000000', NULL, 0),
