(2496481, 340101, 27763, '<td valign="top">Wow!  You''re on fire!!!  Congrats on another red ribbon!!!</td>', 'Wow!  You''re on fire!!!  Congrats on another red ribbon!!!', '2006-06-07 21:38:32.000000', NULL, 0),
