(2498533, 340445, 53147, '<td valign="top">Trading Post - <br/>Brilliant shot and not far of a strecth at all to fit it in the challenge. I gave you and 8 in this and would have bumped it up if I had the opportunity to go back and review my top picks. This was my top pick. Great focus and DOF. Wonderful crop - the height of this shot works great - wouldn''t want it any taller. The colors are gentle and subdued and allow for the bunny to stand out just right. I love this shot and am adding it to my favs. Great job!!!</td>', 'Trading Post - Brilliant shot and not far of a strecth at all to fit it in the challenge. I gave you and 8 in this and would have bumped it up if I had the opportunity to go back and review my top picks. This was my top pick. Great focus and DOF. Wonderful crop - the height of this shot works great - wouldn''t want it any taller. The colors are gentle and subdued and allow for the bunny to stand out just right. I love this shot and am adding it to my favs. Great job!!!', '2006-06-08 12:26:11.000000', NULL, 0),
