(2527766, 340223, 49202, '<td valign="top"><b>CPTdos, ayos!</b> <br/> <br/>Very funky PP, Richard! Yeah, I like the darkness of this.<br/>Also, great take for the challenge. I''d un-crop a bit from the right side, but all in all, it''s a great photo.<br/>I''d''ve woken up the guy, were I you, and ask if he''s sleepy. Hehe.</td>', 'CPTdos, ayos!  Very funky PP, Richard! Yeah, I like the darkness of this.Also, great take for the challenge. I''d un-crop a bit from the right side, but all in all, it''s a great photo.I''d''ve woken up the guy, were I you, and ask if he''s sleepy. Hehe.', '2006-06-19 04:39:22.000000', NULL, 0),
