(2532107, 340713, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very disturbing and surreal. I didn''t vote in, or enter, this challenge because of the possibile (and very likely) high-annoyance factor. But you managed a literal take on a lyric that didn''t annoy me and turned out as good art. I like the flat collage quality. It''s all so flat and almost non-photo like that I don''t even care if that is a real reflection or an Nice work, Don!</td>', 'Very disturbing and surreal. I didn''t vote in, or enter, this challenge because of the possibile (and very likely) high-annoyance factor. But you managed a literal take on a lyric that didn''t annoy me and turned out as good art. I like the flat collage quality. It''s all so flat and almost non-photo like that I don''t even care if that is a real reflection or an Nice work, Don!', '2006-06-20 14:46:23.000000', NULL, 0),
