(2543339, 339705, 25397, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by alfresco:</b></div><hr/><i> How could anyone vote this 5 or below? Focus spot on, crop excellent, composition is flawless, expression is a dandy that fits the title.  The only thing I can think that might improve on the photo is having the right (her right our left) eye less shadowed ... but I''d have to think about that.<br/> <br/>Stellar job Kel - voters are gomers sometimes. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Alfresco, you have a large chest.</td>', 'Originally posted by alfresco: How could anyone vote this 5 or below? Focus spot on, crop excellent, composition is flawless, expression is a dandy that fits the title.  The only thing I can think that might improve on the photo is having the right (her right our left) eye less shadowed ... but I''d have to think about that. Stellar job Kel - voters are gomers sometimes.  Alfresco, you have a large chest.', '2006-06-23 00:51:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2543981, 339214, 41337, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from CTP2</b> <br/> <br/>Striking colors which is what you want to see in a sunset shot. Also good job controlling the highlights. Overall a good job there. The main thing holding this back in my opinion is the cityscape in the background. It''s just a bit drabby with no interesting architecture. Also that construction truck isn''t helping. Not that you could do much about any of that with this shot. Still a strong image and one that met the challenge pretty well. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-23 03:41:58.</i></td>', 'Greetings from CTP2  Striking colors which is what you want to see in a sunset shot. Also good job controlling the highlights. Overall a good job there. The main thing holding this back in my opinion is the cityscape in the background. It''s just a bit drabby with no interesting architecture. Also that construction truck isn''t helping. Not that you could do much about any of that with this shot. Still a strong image and one that met the challenge pretty well. ', '2006-06-23 04:40:50.000000', '2006-06-23 04:41:58.000000', 0),
