(2625605, 340600, 20530, '<td valign="top">That''s strange...I thought I commented on this one, already.<br/> <br/>Well, here goes: Really liked it, even though dolls have always creeped me out. The composition is balanced and enhanced by the doorknob in BG. It''s a great visual pun and a very interesting and compelling image. <br/> <br/>I find the comment "too obvious" a bit ironic, considering the fate of obscure images on this site. Obvious is fine with me...I usually need to be hit over the head to get it. Good job Chris.</td>', 'That''s strange...I thought I commented on this one, already. Well, here goes: Really liked it, even though dolls have always creeped me out. The composition is balanced and enhanced by the doorknob in BG. It''s a great visual pun and a very interesting and compelling image.  I find the comment "too obvious" a bit ironic, considering the fate of obscure images on this site. Obvious is fine with me...I usually need to be hit over the head to get it. Good job Chris.', '2006-07-15 22:12:38.000000', NULL, 0),
