(2834147, 340729, 37858, '<td valign="top">I happened to find these photos while following your link in the self-portrait group.  I didn''t happen to catch them during the Beatles challenge, but I must say your finish at 38 was good, but you deserved even better IMHO.  They top some ahead of you as far as I am concerned.  I love the lighting.  The clarity and detail, especially in her hair, is excellent.  Tones are near perfect as you have left detail visible in a dark dress while still doing justice to her complextion.  Nice composition too.  Well done.  If I had voted in that challenge you would have "earned" and received a 9 or 10 from me.</td>', 'I happened to find these photos while following your link in the self-portrait group.  I didn''t happen to catch them during the Beatles challenge, but I must say your finish at 38 was good, but you deserved even better IMHO.  They top some ahead of you as far as I am concerned.  I love the lighting.  The clarity and detail, especially in her hair, is excellent.  Tones are near perfect as you have left detail visible in a dark dress while still doing justice to her complextion.  Nice composition too.  Well done.  If I had voted in that challenge you would have "earned" and received a 9 or 10 from me.', '2006-09-14 05:56:03.000000', NULL, 0),
