(2903223, 340729, 9285, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model... and very natural in front of the lens.. I love her eyes..<br/> <br/>What attracted me to this photo is the way you control the lighting.. It''s perfect..<br/> <br/>I would like to comment on the angle of the shot.. Her raised hand makes shows much of her biceps. this increases the size of her torso in a manly way. I''m sure she''s much slimer in person, thus this photo makes her look big (not in a good way)<br/> <br/>A slit tilt of angle may do the trick. <br/> <br/>But still a good take</td>', 'Beautiful model... and very natural in front of the lens.. I love her eyes.. What attracted me to this photo is the way you control the lighting.. It''s perfect.. I would like to comment on the angle of the shot.. Her raised hand makes shows much of her biceps. this increases the size of her torso in a manly way. I''m sure she''s much slimer in person, thus this photo makes her look big (not in a good way) A slit tilt of angle may do the trick.  But still a good take', '2006-10-06 14:15:55.000000', NULL, 0),
